          "docs": "Lists the user's cryptocurrency withdrawals.\n\n**Attention:** Due to performance concerns, this endpoint now uses cursor-based pagination. The pagination object currently included in the response is now a placeholder and will be entirely removed as of 2026-06-01. The parameter current_page is also a placeholder and will be removed at the same time. Please update your integration accordingly and refer to the documentation for the correct pagination handling."
